<title>USA: Eagle Bancshares Inc Q3 shr decreases.</title>
<headline>Eagle Bancshares Inc Q3 shr decreases.</headline>
<dateline>TUCKER, Ga. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended December 31</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.27		    $0.44</p>
<p> Net			  1,218		    1,433</p>
<p>Revs</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.79		    $1.18</p>
<p> Net			  3,574		    3,760</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Total assets at December 31, 1996, were $666.17 million versus $558.32 million at December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>Net income for the first nine months of 1996 does not include a one-time assessment of $1.95 million, or $0.26 per share, to recapitalize the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
